# Architecture

```text
                PDF
                 │
                 ▼
          PDF Loader
                 │
                 ▼
            Chunker
                 │
                 ▼
      SentenceTransformer
                 │
                 ▼
              FAISS
                 │
                 │
                 ▼
User Question ─────► Search Engine
                 │
        ┌────────┴────────┐
        ▼                 ▼
     FAISS             BM25
        └──────┬─────────┘
               ▼
    Reciprocal Rank Fusion
               ▼
        Retrieved Chunks
               ▼
       Ollama (Gemma 3)
               ▼
      Answer + Citations
```

